    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit Customer Support. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424629000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is David. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424638400000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11129,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424643000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Certainly, I can help with that. Could I get your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424645000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Jane Doe. Order 788-1259.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11129,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424650533333
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Jane. I see the order here for the Aero-Dynamic helmet. I'm just pulling up the delivery details... Okay, it looks like it was delivered 24 days ago. What seems to be the issue with the item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424652399999
    },
    {
      "text": "The color is just not right. The box is unopened, I haven't even touched it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11129,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424666066665
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. Sometimes colors don't look the same online. Let me just check our return policy for you... one moment.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424671333331
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11129,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424679333331
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, thanks for your patience. I see here that standard items like this helmet are eligible for return within 90 days. Since you're at day 24, you're well within that window. We can absolutely process this return for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424680033331
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Just send me the label.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11129,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424695033331
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. We want to make sure you're completely satisfied, especially with something as important as safety equipment. I've just initiated the return and emailed a prepaid shipping label to the address on file. You should see it in your inbox shortly.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424697433331
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. So I have to find a printer and repackage it myself. Fantastic.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11129,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766424714499997
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, just print the label and affix it to the shipping box. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
